:\"column\",\"flex_align_items\":\"stretch\",\"flex_justify_content\":\"center\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"493745c2\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"Descubre c\\u00f3mo transformar tu forma de comunicar\\u200b\",\"align_mobile\":\"center\",\"align\":\"center\",\"title_color\":\"#1C244B\",\"__globals__\":{\"typography_typography\":\"globals\\/typography?id=heading_l\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"69076fd\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"youtube_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/watch?v=VIDEOID\",\"image_overlay\":{\"id\":789,\"url\":\"http:\\/\\/beta.academia.atora-demo.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2026\\/03\\/placeholder.png\"},\"vimeo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/vimeo.com\\/1097727285?fl=ip&fe=ec\",\"dailymotion_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.dailymotion.com\\/video\\/x6tqhqb\",\"videopress_url\":\"https:\\/\\/videopress.com\\/v\\/ZCAOzTNk\",\"video_type\":\"vimeo\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"video\"}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"21d3433\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"90\",\"right\":\"20\",\"bottom\":\"90\",\"left\":\"20\",\"isLinked\":false}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"a76325c\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"Contexto actual\",\"size\":\"small\",\"header_size\":\"h6\",\"align\":\"center\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"3c1ff9f\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"Hoy no basta con tener talento: hay que saber comunicarlo\",\"size\":\"xl\",\"align\":\"center\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"5e9f4f6\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p>Vivimos en un entorno saturado de informaci\\u00f3n, im\\u00e1genes y est\\u00edmulos. La diferencia ya no la marca solo lo que sabes, sino tu capacidad de expresarlo con claridad, sensibilidad y criterio.<\\/p>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"},{\"id\":\"dd34f77\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"flex_direction\":\"row\",\"gap\":\"22\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"a037403\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":[],\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"88429e7\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"Mucho contenido, poca profundidad\",\"size\":\"medium\",\"header_size\":\"h3\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"f92c95d\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p>Muchas personas publican, hablan o producen, pero pocas logran construir mensajes memorables, coherentes y significativos.<\\/p>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"d195ad3\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":[],\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"c4c0f7e\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"Muchas im\\u00e1genes, poca narrativa\",\"size\":\"medium\",\"header_size\":\"h3\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"cd9281b\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p>Saber usar una c\\u00e1mara, un m\\u00f3vil o una red social no siempre significa saber contar una historia con intenci\\u00f3n y sensibilidad.<\\/p>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"10e2cc2\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":[],\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"50ebda2\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"Mucha exposici\\u00f3n, poca conexi\\u00f3n humana\",\"size\":\"medium\",\"header_size\":\"h3\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"57a7b81\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p>La comunicaci\\u00f3n aut\\u00e9ntica exige comprender emociones, contextos, v\\u00ednculos y relaciones, no solo dominar herramientas.<\\/p>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":true}],\"isInner\":true}],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"76bce10\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"90\",\"right\":\"20\",\"bottom\":\"90\",\"left\":\"20\",\"isLinked\":false},\"flex_direction\":\"row\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"06e89d8\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":45},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"edf0e53\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"image\":{\"id\":790,\"url\":\"http:\\/\\/beta.academia.atora-demo.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2026\\/03\\/Ministura-Psicologia-1024x683-1.jpg\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"image\"}],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"e48083f\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":55},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"ac9d376\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"Nuestra propuesta\",\"size\":\"small\",\"header_size\":\"h6\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"cb6ec02\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"Una academia dise\\u00f1ada para formar criterio, voz y presencia\",\"size\":\"xl\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"0f1bef5\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p>Academia Atm\\u00f3sfera Creativa re\\u00fane formaci\\u00f3n en comunicaci\\u00f3n, fotograf\\u00eda, narrativa visual y psicolog\\u00eda de la comunicaci\\u00f3n para desarrollar profesionales m\\u00e1s completos, sensibles y estrat\\u00e9gicos.<\\/p><p>No se trata solo de aprender teor\\u00eda. Se trata de adquirir herramientas reales para comunicar mejor, observar mejor, crear mejor y conectar mejor.<\\/p>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"},{\"id\":\"e60f6cb\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<ul><li><strong>Mentores con experiencia real:<\\/strong> aprende con profesionales que han vivido lo que ense\\u00f1an.<\\/li><li><strong>Aplicaci\\u00f3n inmediata:<\\/strong> lleva cada aprendizaje a tu trabajo, proyecto o pr\\u00e1ctica profesional.<\\/li><li><strong>Formaci\\u00f3n interdisciplinaria:<\\/strong> integra imagen, pensamiento, discurso y relaciones humanas.<\\/li><li><strong>Flexibilidad online:<\\/strong> avanza con profundidad y a tu ritmo.<\\/li><\\/ul>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":true}],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"2719d32\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"set