ertiva y la manera en que conectamos con otros. Una base esencial para comunicar con inteligencia emocional y profundidad.<\\/p>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"},{\"id\":\"ebf6242\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"text\":\"Ver curso\",\"link\":{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/beta.academia.atora-demo.com\\/lm_course\\/psicologia-de-la-comunicacion\\/\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"button\"}],\"isInner\":true}],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"42070d0\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"flex_direction\":\"row\",\"gap\":\"22\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"91937c9\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":[],\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"a291552\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"image\":{\"id\":795,\"url\":\"http:\\/\\/beta.academia.atora-demo.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2026\\/03\\/Creacion-de-discursos-1-1024x576-1.jpg\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"image\"},{\"id\":\"8762d68\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"Periodismo, Pol\\u00edtica y Formas de Expresi\\u00f3n\",\"size\":\"medium\",\"header_size\":\"h3\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"4da1510\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p><strong>Mentor: Don Manuel Felipe Sierra<\\/strong><\\/p><p>Una reflexi\\u00f3n sobre la vigencia del periodismo, la radio, la televisi\\u00f3n y las redes sociales como espacios de influencia, pensamiento y construcci\\u00f3n de realidad.<\\/p>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"},{\"id\":\"6122d89\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"text\":\"Ver curso\",\"link\":{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/beta.academia.atora-demo.com\\/lm_course\\/creacion-de-discursos\\/\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"button\"}],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"c902ff1\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":[],\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"1fff6f6\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"image\":{\"id\":796,\"url\":\"http:\\/\\/beta.academia.atora-demo.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2026\\/03\\/Miniatura-Maestria-de-la-luzweb-1024x576-1.jpg\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"image\"},{\"id\":\"9c0cae7\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"Maestr\\u00eda de la Luz (Fotograf\\u00eda Avanzada)\",\"size\":\"medium\",\"header_size\":\"h3\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"e18c04c\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p><strong>Mentores: Prof. Liduzka Derett y Luis Noguera<\\/strong><\\/p><p>Un recorrido por la t\\u00e9cnica fotogr\\u00e1fica desde la historia del arte, la sensibilidad est\\u00e9tica y el uso expresivo de luces y sombras para construir relatos visuales memorables.<\\/p>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"},{\"id\":\"a3e094b\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"text\":\"Ver curso\",\"link\":{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/beta.academia.atora-demo.com\\/lm_course\\/maestria-de-la-luz\\/\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"button\"}],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"0a017e5\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":[],\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"c7bdcb4\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"image\":{\"id\":797,\"url\":\"http:\\/\\/beta.academia.atora-demo.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2026\\/03\\/Captura-de-pantalla-2026-01-20-a-las-7.55.17-p.-m-1024x571-1.png\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"image\"},{\"id\":\"b42e0a7\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"Taller de Fotograf\\u00eda con Intenci\\u00f3n\",\"size\":\"medium\",\"header_size\":\"h3\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"c7d339b\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p><strong>Mentor: Juan Carlos Incoronato<\\/strong><\\/p><p>Aprende a transformar im\\u00e1genes en mensajes con prop\\u00f3sito. Ideal para desarrollar narrativa visual, coherencia est\\u00e9tica y expresi\\u00f3n emocional con c\\u00e1mara o m\\u00f3vil.<\\/p>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"},{\"id\":\"2614a3d\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"text\":\"Ver curso\",\"link\":{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/beta.academia.atora-demo.com\\/lm_course\\/fotografia-con-intencion\\/\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"button\"}],\"isInner\":true}],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"e633e11\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"flex_direction\":\"row\",\"gap\":\"22\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"46c1570\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":[],\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"58afd32\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"image\":{\"id\":798,\"url\":\"http:\\/\\/beta.academia.atora-demo.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2026\\/03\\/Clase-2-Comunidacion-visual-y-Redes-Sociales-1024x576-1.jpg\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"image\"},{\"id\":\"b3f3fee\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"Comunicaci\\u00f3n Visual y Redes Sociales: Estrategia y Narrativa Digital\",\"size\":\"medium\",\"header_size\":\"h3\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"f780821\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p><strong>Mentor: Prof. Marco Tulio Gonz\\u00e1lez<\\/strong><\\/p><p>Domina herramientas para crear contenido de alto impacto, construir identidad visual y desarrollar narrativas coherentes para Instagram, TikTok y otros ecosistemas digitales.<\\/p>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"},{\"id\":\"ebf4d85\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"text\":\"Ver curso\",\"link\":{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/beta.academia.atora-demo.com\\/lm_course\\/comunicacion-visual-y-redes-sociales-marco-gonzalez\\/\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"button\"}],\"isInner\":true}],\"isInner\":true}],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"ee0c281\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"90\",\"right\":\"20\",\"bottom\":\"90\",\"left\":\"20\",\"isLinked\":false},\"flex_direction\":\"row\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"065af9c\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":40},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"b28364d\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"image\":{\"id\":799,\"url\":\"http:\\/\\/beta.academia.atora-demo.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2026\\/03\\/logo-apaisado-1024x256-1.jpg\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"image\"}],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"f42ebca\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":60},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"2e1a345\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"\\u00bfPor qu\\u00e9 elegir Academia Atm\\u00f3sfera Creativa?\",\"size\":\"xl\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"cbb4b51\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p>A diferencia de formaciones gen\\u00e9ricas, nuestra propuesta parte de la experiencia real, el pensamiento cr\\u00edtico y la integraci\\u00f3n entre comunicaci\\u00f3n, fotograf\\u00eda y relaciones humanas.<\\/p><ul><li>Mentores de trayectoria comprobada<\\/li><li>Visi\\u00f3n multidisciplinaria<\\/li><li>Formaci\\u00f3n flexible<\\/li><li>Enfoque humano y aplicable<\\/li><\\/ul>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":true}],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"ee14685\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"90\",\"right\":\"20\",\"bottom\":\"90\",\"left\":\"20\",\"isLinked\":false}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"e22ad49\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"Testimonios\",\"size\":\"small\",\"header_size\":\"h6\",\"align\":\"center\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"9e8f893\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"Lo que dicen nuestros estudiantes\",\"size\":\"xl\",\"align\":\"center\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"1c5687b\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p>\\u201cLa experiencia super\\u00f3 mis expectativas. No solo aprend\\u00ed herramientas nuevas: cambi\\u00e9 mi manera de observar y narrar con mis im\\u00e1genes.\\u201d<br><strong>Participante<\\/strong> \\u2014 Fotograf\\u00eda con intenci\\u00f3n<\\/p><p>\\u201cEncontr\\u00e9 una formaci\\u00f3n seria, clara y profundamente \\u00fatil para mi trabajo. Los contenidos me ayudaron a comunicar mejor mi proyecto.\\u201d<br><strong>Participante<\\/strong> \\u2014 Comunicaci\\u00f3n visual y redes sociales<\\/p><p>\\u201cEl curso de Psicolog\\u00eda de la Comunicaci\\u00f3n cambi\\u00f3 mi forma de relacionarme con clientes y equipos. Fue una experiencia transformadora.\\u201d<br><strong>Participante<\\/strong> \\u2014 Psicolog\\u00eda de la comunicaci\\u00f3n<\\/p>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"},{\"id\":\"9775ce2\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"container_type\":\"grid\",\"presetTitle\":\"Grid\",\"presetIcon\":\"eicon-container-grid\",\"content_width\":\"full\",\"grid_columns_grid\":{\"unit\":\"fr\",\"size\":2,\"sizes\":[]},\"grid_rows_grid\":{\"unit\":\"fr\",\"size\":1,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"b009434\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"video_type\":\"hosted\",\"youtube_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/watch?v=XHOmBV4js_E\",\"vimeo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/vimeo.com\\/235215203\",\"dailymotion_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.dailymotion.com\\/video\\/x6tqhqb\",\"hosted_url\":{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/academia.atora-demo.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2025\\/12\\/Testimonio-Samy-HD-720p-1.mp4\",\"id\":240,\"size\":\"\",\"alt\":\"\",\"source\":\"library\"},\"videopress_url\":\"https:\\/\\/videopress.com\\/v\\/ZCAOzTNk\",\"poster\":{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/academia.atora-demo.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2026\\/04\\/testimonio-atora-demo-Samy.jpg\",\"id\":4812,\"size\":\"\",\"alt\":\"\",\"source\":\"library\"},\"show_image_overlay\":\"yes\",\"image_overlay\":{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/academia.atora-demo.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2026\\/04\\/testimonio-atora-demo-Samy.jpg\",\"id\":4812,\"size\":\"\",\"alt\":\"\",\"source\":\"library\"},\"aspect_ratio\":\"916\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"video\"},{\"id\":\"6397e07\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"video_type\":\"hosted\",\"youtube_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/watch?v=XHOmBV4js_E\",\"vimeo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/vimeo.com\\/235215203\",\"dailymotion_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.dailymotion.com\\/video\\/x6tqhqb\",\"hosted_url\":{\"url\":\