:\"container\",\"settings\":[],\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"369bf1a3\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"image\":{\"id\":793,\"url\":\"http:\\/\\/beta.academia.atora-demo.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2026\\/03\\/Ministura-CZ-c1-peq.jpg\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"image\"},{\"id\":\"64c95aa1\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"Evoluci\\u00f3n Medi\\u00e1tica y Contexto Global\",\"size\":\"medium\",\"header_size\":\"h3\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"6d102742\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p><strong>Mentor: Carlos Zavarce<\\/strong><\\/p><p>Un recorrido anal\\u00edtico por la historia de los medios y la construcci\\u00f3n de la opini\\u00f3n p\\u00fablica. Perfecto para comprender el ecosistema comunicacional actual con m\\u00e1s criterio y contexto.<\\/p>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"},{\"id\":\"d0744bd\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"text\":\"Ver curso\",\"link\":{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/beta.academia.atora-demo.com\\/cursos\\/100-comunicacion-carlos-zavarce\\/\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"button\"}],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"1228a05f\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":[],\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"36104f0a\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"image\":{\"id\":794,\"url\":\"http:\\/\\/beta.academia.atora-demo.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2026\\/03\\/Ministura-Psicologia-1024x683-2.jpg\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"image\"},{\"id\":\"3c08afea\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"Psicolog\\u00eda de la Comunicaci\\u00f3n y Relaciones Humanas\",\"size\":\"medium\",\"header_size\":\"h3\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"2087ca2b\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p><strong>Mentor: Dr. Renny Yagosesky<\\/strong><\\/p><p>Explora el comportamiento humano, la comunicaci\\u00f3n asertiva y la manera en que conectamos con otros. Una base esencial para comunicar con inteligencia emocional y profundidad.<\\/p>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"},{\"id\":\"f32f84d\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"text\":\"Ver curso\",\"link\":{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/beta.academia.atora-demo.com\\/lm_course\\/psicologia-de-la-comunicacion\\/\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"button\"}],\"isInner\":true}],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"334c5c93\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"flex_direction\":\"row\",\"gap\":\"22\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"1ead06f8\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":[],\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"40320f3e\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"image\":{\"id\":795,\"url\":\"http:\\/\\/beta.academia.atora-demo.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2026\\/03\\/Creacion-de-discursos-1-1024x576-1.jpg\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"image\"},{\"id\":\"3592d45b\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"Periodismo, Pol\\u00edtica y Formas de Expresi\\u00f3n\",\"size\":\"medium\",\"header_size\":\"h3\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"1316747c\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p><strong>Mentor: Don Manuel Felipe Sierra<\\/strong><\\/p><p>Una reflexi\\u00f3n sobre la vigencia del periodismo, la radio, la televisi\\u00f3n y las redes sociales como espacios de influencia, pensamiento y construcci\\u00f3n de realidad.<\\/p>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"},{\"id\":\"122a4693\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"text\":\"Ver curso\",\"link\":{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/beta.academia.atora-demo.com\\/lm_course\\/creacion-de-discursos\\/\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"button\"}],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"5e6f9a04\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":[],\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"4a3d049c\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"image\":{\"id\":796,\"url\":\"http:\\/\\/beta.academia.atora-demo.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2026\\/03\\/Miniatura-Maestria-de-la-luzweb-1024x576-1.jpg\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"image\"},{\"id\":\"5787856b\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"Ma