entender la luz como lenguaje y a usar la t\\u00e9cnica como una herramienta para expresar lo que sientes y observas.<br \\/>A lo largo de este curso, descubrir\\u00e1s c\\u00f3mo tomar el control de tus recursos fotogr\\u00e1ficos \\u2014sea una c\\u00e1mara profesional o tu celular\\u2014 para crear fotos que hablen por s\\u00ed mismas. Aprender\\u00e1s a mirar con prop\\u00f3sito, a construir series coherentes y a comunicar ideas, emociones y conceptos mediante la composici\\u00f3n, el color y la narrativa visual.<\\/p>\\n<p><!-- \\/wp:embed --><!-- wp:paragraph --><\\/p>\\n<p><!-- \\/wp:paragraph --><\\/p>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"},{\"id\":\"db05cd4\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"content_width\":\"full\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"8f12fd3\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"container_type\":\"grid\",\"presetTitle\":\"Grid\",\"presetIcon\":\"eicon-container-grid\",\"content_width\":\"full\",\"grid_columns_grid\":{\"unit\":\"fr\",\"size\":2,\"sizes\":[]},\"grid_rows_grid\":{\"unit\":\"fr\",\"size\":1,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"85cc5fd\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"image\":{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/academia.atora-demo.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2026\\/01\\/MG_2944.CR2_-scaled-1.jpg\",\"id\":766,\"size\":\"\",\"alt\":\"\",\"source\":\"library\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"image\"},{\"id\":\"f5ff9fa\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"youtube_url\":\"https:\\/\\/youtu.be\\/l5dZlAYvGYM?si=dgOpSmvza1vIfCM8\",\"vimeo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/vimeo.com\\/235215203\",\"dailymotion_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.dailymotion.com\\/video\\/x6tqhqb\",\"videopress_url\":\"https:\\/\\/videopress.com\\/v\\/ZCAOzTNk\",\"_flex_align_self\":\"center\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"video\"}],\"isInner\":true}],\"isInner\":true}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"b873744\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":[],\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"86df162\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"<span style=\\\"color: rgb(86, 86, 86); font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; white-space: normal;\\\">El Profesor&nbsp;<\\/span><a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/instagram.com\\/jincoronato\\\" style=\\\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(204, 51, 102); font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; white-space: normal;\\\">Juan Carlos Incoronato<\\/a><span style=\\\"color: rgb(86, 86, 86); font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; white-space: normal;\\\">&nbsp;es un docente extraordinario, un apasionado de la fotograf\\u00eda y de ense\\u00f1arla. M\\u00e1s de 25 a\\u00f1os en docencia universitaria, una larga trayectoria, no solo como fot\\u00f3gafo, sino como periodista, documentalista, cineasta y promotor cultural.<\\/span><br style=\\\"color: rgb(86, 86, 86); font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; white-space: normal;\\\"><span style=\\\"color: rgb(86, 86, 86); font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; white-space: normal;\\\">Si quieres saber un poco m\\u00e1s de su vida, mira nuestro Poscast:&nbsp;<\\/span><a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/youtu.be\\/l5dZlAYvGYM?si=dgOpSmvza1vIfCM8\\\" style=\\\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(204, 51, 102); font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; white-space: normal;\\\">Hablando se entiende...&nbsp;<\\/a><span style=\\\"color: rgb(86, 86, 86); font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; white-space: normal;\\\">en el que nos habla de toda su pasi\\u00f3n y mucho m\\u00e1<\\/span>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"8a60a2d\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"flex_direction\":\"column\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"afb4e76\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"wp_gallery\":[{\"id\":5817,\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/academia.atora-demo.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2026\\/05\\/photo_2025-10-24_02-27-30.jpg\"},{\"id\":5818,\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/academia.atora-demo.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2026\\/05\\/photo_2025-10-24_02-27-37.jpg\"},{\"id\":5819,\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/academia.atora-demo.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2026\\/05\\/Captura-de-pantalla-2