le\",\"margin\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":\"\"},\"padding\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"top\":\"012\",\"right\":\"3\",\"bottom\":\"12\",\"left\":\"3\",\"isLinked\":\"\"},\"padding_tablet\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"5\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"5\",\"isLinked\":\"\"},\"reverse_order_tablet\":\"reverse-tablet\",\"reverse_order_mobile\":\"reverse-mobile\",\"margin_tablet\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"top\":\"15\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":\"\"},\"margin_mobile\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"top\":\"25\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":\"\"},\"_title\":\"CTA\",\"boxed_width\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":1000,\"sizes\":[]},\"padding_mobile\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"top\":\"\",\"right\":\"\",\"bottom\":\"\",\"left\":\"\",\"isLinked\":\"1\"},\"boxed_width_tablet\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":\"500\",\"sizes\":[]},\"flex_direction\":\"column\",\"flex_align_items\":\"stretch\",\"flex_justify_content\":\"center\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"493745c2\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"Descubre c\\u00f3mo transformar tu forma de comunicar\\u200b\",\"align_mobile\":\"center\",\"align\":\"center\",\"title_color\":\"#1C244B\",\"__globals__\":{\"typography_typography\":\"globals\\/typography?id=heading_l\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"69076fd\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"youtube_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/watch?v=VIDEOID\",\"image_overlay\":{\"id\":789,\"url\":\"http:\\/\\/beta.academia.atora-demo.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2026\\/03\\/placeholder.png\"},\"vimeo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/vimeo.com\\/1097727285?fl=ip&fe=ec\",\"dailymotion_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.dailymotion.com\\/video\\/x6tqhqb\",\"videopress_url\":\"https:\\/\\/videopress.com\\/v\\/ZCAOzTNk\",\"video_type\":\"vimeo\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"video\"}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"21d3433\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"90\",\"right\":\"20\",\"bottom\":\"90\",\"left\":\"20\",\"isLinked\":false}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"a76325c\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"Contexto actual\",\"size\":\"small\",\"header_size\":\"h6\",\"align\":\"center\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"3c1ff9f\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"Hoy no basta con tener talento: hay que saber comunicarlo\",\"size\":\"xl\",\"align\":\"center\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"5e9f4f6\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p>Vivimos en un entorno saturado de informaci\\u00f3n, im\\u00e1genes y est\\u00edmulos. La diferencia ya no la marca solo lo que sabes, sino tu capacidad de expresarlo con claridad, sensibilidad y criterio.<\\/p>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"},{\"id\":\"dd34f77\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"flex_direction\":\"row\",\"gap\":\"22\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"a037403\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":[],\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"88429e7\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"Mucho contenido, poca profundidad\",\"size\":\"medium\",\"header_size\":\"h3\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"f92c95d\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p>Muchas personas publican, hablan o producen, pero pocas logran construir mensajes memorables, coherentes y significativos.<\\/p>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"d195ad3\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":[],\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"c4c0f7e\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"Muchas im\\u00e1genes, poca narrativa\",\"size\":\"medium\",\"header_size\":\"h3\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"cd9281b\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p>Saber usar una c\\u00e1mara, un m\\u00f3vil o una red social no siempre significa saber contar una historia con intenci\\u00f3n y sensibilidad.<\\/p>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"10e2cc2\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":[],\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"50ebda2\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"Mucha exposici\\u00f3n, poca conexi\\u00f3n humana\",\"size\":\"medium\",\"header_size\":\"h3\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"57a7b81\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p>La comunicaci\\u00f3n aut\\u00e9ntica exige comprender emociones, contextos, v\\u00ednculos y relaciones, no solo dominar herramientas.<\\/p>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":true}],\"isInner\":true}],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"76bce10\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"90\",\"right\":\"20\",\"bottom\":\"90\",\"left\":\"20\",\"isLinked\":false},\"flex_direction\":\"row\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"06e89d8\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":45},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"edf0e53\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"image\":{\"id\":790,\"url\":\"http:\\/\\/beta.academia.atora-demo.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2026\\/03\\/Ministura-Psicologia-1024x683-1.jpg\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"image\"}],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"e48083f\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":55},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"ac9d376\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"Nuestra propuesta\",\"size\":\"small\",\"header_size\":\"h6\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"cb6ec02\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"Una academia dise\\u00f1ada para formar criterio, voz y presencia\",\"size\":\"xl\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"0f1bef5\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p>Academia Atm\\u00f3sfera Creativa re\\u00fane formaci\\u00f3n en comunicaci\\u00f3n, fotograf\\u00eda, narrativa visual y psicolog\\u00eda de la comunicaci\\u00f3n para desarrollar profesionales m\\u00e1s completos, sensibles y estrat\\u00e9gicos.<\\/p><p>No se trata solo de aprender teor\\u00eda. Se trata de adquirir herramientas reales para comunicar mejor, observar mejor, crear mejor y conectar mejor.<\\/p>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"},{\"id\":\"e60f6cb\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<ul><li><strong>Mentores con experiencia real:<\\/strong> aprende con profesionales que han vivido lo que ense\\u00f1an.<\\/li><li><strong>Aplicaci\\u00f3n inmediata:<\\/strong> lleva cada aprendizaje a tu trabajo, proyecto o pr\\u00e1ctica profesional.<\\/li><li><strong>Formaci\\u00f3n interdisciplinaria:<\\/strong> integra imagen, pensamiento, discurso y relaciones humanas.<\\/li><li><strong>Flexibilidad online:<\\/strong> avanza con profundidad y a tu ritmo.<\\/li><\\/ul>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":true}],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"2719d32\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"90\",\"right\":\"20\",\"bottom\":\"90\",\"left\":\"20\",\"isLinked\":false}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"eb24503\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"Oferta formativa\",\"size\":\"small\",\"header_size\":\"h6\",\"align\":\"center\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"1145f45\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"Cursos y programas para profundizar tu formaci\\u00f3n\",\"size\":\"xl\",\"align\":\"center\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"81a72b0\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p>Cada curso aborda una dimensi\\u00f3n clave del comunicador contempor\\u00e1neo: pensamiento, imagen, discurso, relaciones humanas y estrategia narrativa.<\\/p>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"},{\"id\":\"cd0bcd4\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"flex_direction\":\"row\",\"gap\":\"22\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"8483d06\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":[],\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"a5af443\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"image\":{\"id\":792,\"url\":\"http:\\/\\/beta.academia.atora-demo.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2026\\/03\\/Portada-educaion-para-comunicadores2-300x169-1.jpg\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"image\"},{\"id\":\"5162652\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"Educaci\\u00f3n para comunicadores\",\"size\":\"medium\",\"header_size\":\"h3\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"814d5d1\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p><strong>Mentora: Dra. Natchaieving M\\u00e9ndez<\\/strong><\\/p><p>Una invitaci\\u00f3n a comprender la comunicaci\\u00f3n como una fuerza que educa, transforma y deja huella. Ideal para quienes desean comunicar con sensibilidad, profundidad e impacto humano.<\\/p>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"},{\"id\":\"a0168f2\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"text\":\"Ver curso\",\"link\":{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/beta.academia.atora-demo.com\\/cursos\\/educacion-para-comunicadores\\/\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"button\"}],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"b906704\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":[],\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"c50930c\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"image\":{\"id\":793,\"url\":\"http:\\/\\/beta.academia.atora-demo.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2026\\/03\\/Ministura-CZ-c1-peq.jpg\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"image\"},{\"id\":\"83986f1\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"Evoluci\\u00f3n Medi\\u00e1tica y Contexto Global\",\"size\":\"medium\",\"header_size\":\"h3\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"7df5589\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p><strong>Mentor: Carlos Zavarce<\\/strong><\\/p><p>Un recorrido anal\\u00edtico por la historia de los medios y la construcci\\u00f3n de la opini\\u00f3n p\\u00fablica. Perfecto para comprender el ecosistema comunicacional actual con m\\u00e1s criterio y contexto.<\\/p>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"},{\"id\":\"9a7b7ab\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"text\":\"Ver curso\",\"link\":{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/beta.academia.atora-demo.com\\/cursos\\/100-comunicacion-carlos-zavarce\\/\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"button\"}],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"33ba692\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":[],\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"c1d5218\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"image\":{\"id\":794,\"url\":\"http:\\/\\/beta.academia.atora-demo.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2026\\/03\\/Ministura-Psicologia-1024x683-2.jpg\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"image\"},{\"id\":\"93f6058\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"Psicolog\\u00eda de la Comunicaci\\u00f3n y Relaciones Humanas\",\"size\":\"medium\",\"header_size\":\"h3\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"295342b\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p><strong>Mentor: Dr. Renny Yagosesky<\\/strong><\\/p><p>Explora el comportamiento humano, la comunicaci\\u00f3n asertiva y la manera en que conectamos con otros. Una base esencial para comunicar con inteligencia emocional y profundidad.<\\/p>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"},{\"id\":\"ebf6242\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"text\":\"Ver curso\",\"link\":{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/beta.academia.atora-demo.com\\/lm_course\\/psicologia-de-la-comunicacion\\/\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"button\"}],\"isInner\":true}],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"42070d0\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"flex_direction\":\"row\",\"gap\":\"22\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"91937c9\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":[],\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"a291552\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"image\":{\"id\":795,\"url\":\"http:\\/\\/beta.academia.atora-demo.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2026\\/03\\/Creacion-de-discursos-1-1024x576-1.jpg\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"image\"},{\"id\":\"8762d68\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"Periodismo, Pol\\u00edtica y Formas de Expresi\\u00f3n\",\"size\":\"medium\",\"header_size\":\"h3\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"4da1510\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p><strong>Mentor: Don Manuel Felipe Sierra<\\/strong><\\/p><p>Una reflexi\\u00f3n sobre la vigencia del periodismo, la radio, la televisi\\u00f3n y las redes sociales como espacios de influencia, pensamiento y construcci\\u00f3n de realidad.<\\/p>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"},{\"id\":\"6122d89\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"text\":\"Ver curso\",\"link\":{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/beta.academia.atora-demo.com\\/lm_course\\/creacion-de-discursos\\/\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"button\"}],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"c902ff1\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":[],\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"1fff6f6\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"image\":{\"id\":796,\"url\":\"http:\\/\\/beta.academia.atora-demo.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2026\\/03\\/Miniatura-Maestria-de-la-luzweb-1024x576-1.jpg\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"image\"},{\"id\":\"9c0cae7\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"Maestr\\u00eda de la Luz (Fotograf\\u00eda Avanzada)\",\"size\":\"medium\",\"header_size\":\"h3\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"e18c04c\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p><strong>Mentores: Prof. Liduzka Derett y Luis Noguera<\\/strong><\\/p><p>Un recorrido por la t\\u00e9cnica fotogr\\u00e1fica desde la historia del arte, la sensibilidad est\\u00e9tica y el uso expresivo de luces y sombras para construir relatos visuales memorables.<\\/p>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"},{\"id\":\"a3e094b\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"text\":\"Ver curso\",\"link\":{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/beta.academia.atora-demo.com\\/lm_course\\/maestria-de-la-luz\\/\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"button\"}],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"0a017e5\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":[],\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"c7bdcb4\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"image\":{\"id\":797,\"url\":\"http:\\/\\/beta.academia.atora-demo.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2026\\/03\\/Captura-de-pantalla-2026-01-20-a-las-7.55.17-p.-m-1024x571-1.png\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"image\"},{\"id\":\"b42e0a7\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"Taller de Fotograf\\u00eda con Intenci\\u00f3n\",\"size\":\"medium\",\"header_size\":\"h3\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"c7d339b\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p><strong>Mentor: Juan Carlos Incoronato<\\/strong><\\/p><p>Aprende a transformar im\\u00e1genes en mensajes con prop\\u00f3sito. Ideal para desarrollar narrativa visual, coherencia est\\u00e9tica y expresi\\u00f3n emocional con c\\u00e1mara o m\\u00f3vil.<\\/p>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"},{\"id\":\"2614a3d\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"text\":\"Ver curso\",\"link\":{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/beta.academia.atora-demo.com\\/lm_course\\/fotografia-con-intencion\\/\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"button\"}],\"isInner\":true}],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"e633e11\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"flex_direction\":\"row\",\"gap\":\"22\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"46c1570\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":[],\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"58afd32\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"image\":{\"id\":798,\"url\":\"http:\\/\\/beta.academia.atora-demo.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2026\\/03\\/Clase-2-Comunidacion-visual-y-Redes-Sociales-1024x576-1.jpg\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"image\"},{\"id\":\"b3f3fee\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"Comunicaci\\u00f3n Visual y Redes Sociales: Estrategia y Narrativa Digital\",\"size\":\"medium\",\"header_size\":\"h3\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"f780821\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p><strong>Mentor: Prof. Marco Tulio Gonz\\u00e1lez<\\/strong><\\/p><p>Domina herramientas para crear contenido de alto impacto, construir identidad visual y desarrollar narrativas coherentes para Instagram, TikTok y otros ecosistemas digitales.<\\/p>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"},{\"id\":\"ebf4d85\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"text\":\"Ver curso\",\"link\":{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/beta.academia.atora-demo.com\\/lm_course\\/comunicacion-visual-y-redes-sociales-marco-gonzalez\\/\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"button\"}],\"isInner\":true}],\"isInner\":true}],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"ee0c281\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"90\",\"right\":\"20\",\"bottom\":\"90\",\"left\":\"20\",\"isLinked\":false},\"flex_direction\":\"row\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"065af9c\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":40},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"b28364d\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"image\":{\"id\":799,\"url\":\"http:\\/\\/beta.academia.atora-demo.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2026\\/03\\/logo-apaisado-1024x256-1.jpg\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"image\"}],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"f42ebca\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":60},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"2e1a345\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"\\u00bfPor qu\\u00e9 elegir Academia Atm\\u00f3sfera Creativa?\",\"size\":\"xl\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"cbb4b51\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p>A diferencia de formaciones gen\\u00e9ricas, nuestra propuesta parte de la experiencia real, el pensamiento cr\\u00edtico y la integraci\\u00f3n entre comunicaci\\u00f3n, fotograf\\u00eda y relaciones humanas.<\\/p><ul><li>Mentores de trayectoria comprobada<\\/li><li>Visi\\u00f3n multidisciplinaria<\\/li><li>Formaci\\u00f3n flexible<\\/li><li>Enfoque humano y aplicable<\\/li><\\/ul>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":true}],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"ee14685\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"90\",\"right\":\"20\",\"bottom\":\"90\",\"left\":\"20\",\"isLinked\":false}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"e22ad49\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"Testimonios\",\"size\":\"small\",\"header_size\":\"h6\",\"align\":\"center\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"9e8f893\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"Lo que dicen nuestros estudiantes\",\"size\":\"xl\",\"align\":\"center\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"1c5687b\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p>\\u201cLa experiencia super\\u00f3 mis expectativas. No solo aprend\\u00ed herramientas nuevas: cambi\\u00e9 mi manera de observar y narrar con mis im\\u00e1genes.\\u201d<br><strong>Participante<\\/strong> \\u2014 Fotograf\\u00eda con intenci\\u00f3n<\\/p><p>\\u201cEncontr\\u00e9 una formaci\\u00f3n seria, clara y profundamente \\u00fatil para mi trabajo. Los contenidos me ayudaron a comunicar mejor mi proyecto.\\u201d<br><strong>Participante<\\/strong> \\u2014 Comunicaci\\u00f3n visual y redes sociales<\\/p><p>\\u201cEl curso de Psicolog\\u00eda de la Comunicaci\\u00f3n cambi\\u00f3 mi forma de relacionarme con clientes y equipos. Fue una experiencia transformadora.\\u201d<br><strong>Participante<\\/strong> \\u2014 Psicolog\\u00eda de la comunicaci\\u00f3n<\\/p>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"},{\"id\":\"9775ce2\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"container_type\":\"grid\",\"presetTitle\":\"Grid\",\"presetIcon\":\"eicon-container-grid\",\"content_width\":\"full\",\"grid_columns_grid\":{\"unit\":\"fr\",\"size\":2,\"sizes\":[]},\"grid_rows_grid\":{\"unit\":\"fr\",\"size\":1,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"b009434\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"video_type\":\"hosted\",\"youtube_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/watch?v=XHOmBV4js_E\",\"vimeo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/vimeo.com\\/235215203\",\"dailymotion_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.dailymotion.com\\/video\\/x6tqhqb\",\"hosted_url\":{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/academia.atora-demo.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2025\\/12\\/Testimo