lements\":[{\"id\":\"4a046a93\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"Descubre c\\u00f3mo transformar tu forma de comunicar\",\"size\":\"xl\",\"align\":\"center\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"a63c655\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p>En este breve video descubrir\\u00e1s por qu\\u00e9 la comunicaci\\u00f3n, la narrativa visual y la comprensi\\u00f3n de las relaciones humanas se han convertido en habilidades clave para crecer profesionalmente, liderar con claridad y construir una presencia aut\\u00e9ntica.<\\/p>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"},{\"id\":\"6431787\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"youtube_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/watch?v=VIDEOID\",\"image_overlay\":{\"id\":789,\"url\":\"http:\\/\\/beta.academia.atora-demo.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2026\\/03\\/placeholder.png\"},\"vimeo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/vimeo.com\\/1097727285?fl=pl&fe=cm\",\"dailymotion_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.dailymotion.com\\/video\\/x6tqhqb\",\"videopress_url\":\"https:\\/\\/videopress.com\\/v\\/ZCAOzTNk\",\"video_type\":\"vimeo\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"video\"},{\"id\":\"42dd0b7b\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"text\":\"Explorar la academia\",\"link\":{\"url\":\"#programas-destacados\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"button\"}],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"1524e86c\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"90\",\"right\":\"20\",\"bottom\":\"90\",\"left\":\"20\",\"isLinked\":false}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"2a4377c9\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"Contexto actual\",\"size\":\"small\",\"header_size\":\"h6\",\"align\":\"center\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"3e718a89\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"Hoy no basta con tener talento: hay que saber comunicarlo\",\"size\":\"xl\",\"align\":\"center\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"4b13adcb\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p>Vivimos en un entorno saturado de informaci\\u00f3n, im\\u00e1genes y est\\u00edmulos. La diferencia ya no la marca solo lo que sabes, sino tu capacidad de expresarlo con claridad, sensibilidad y criterio.<\\/p>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"},{\"id\":\"241acf5a\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"flex_direction\":\"row\",\"gap\":\"22\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"64102106\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":[],\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"52305efc\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"Mucho contenido, poca profundidad\",\"size\":\"medium\",\"header_size\":\"h3\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"6c086bd9\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p>Muchas personas publican, hablan o producen, pero pocas logran construir mensajes memorables, coherentes y significativos.<\\/p>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"7724de41\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":[],\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"4e9e99f6\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"Muchas im\\u00e1genes, poca narrativa\",\"size\":\"medium\",\"header_size\":\"h3\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"77313a24\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p>Saber usar una c\\u00e1mara, un m\\u00f3vil o una red social no siempre significa saber contar una historia con intenci\\u00f3n y sensibilidad.<\\/p>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"9d365b2\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":[],\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"2563e9b3\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"Mucha exposici\\u00f3n, poca conexi\\u00f3n humana\",\"size\":\"medium\",\"header_size\":\"h3\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"79dbf738\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p>La comunicaci\\u00f3n aut\\u00e9ntica exige comprender emociones, contextos, v\\u00ednculos y relaciones, no solo dominar herramientas.<\\/p>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":true}],\"isInner\":true}],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"37996009\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"90\",\"right\":\"20\",\"bottom\":\"90\",\"left\":\"20\",\"isLinked\":false},\"flex_direction\":\"row\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"1df891ff\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":45},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"7d29e20c\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"image\":{\"id\":790,\"url\":\"http:\\/\\/beta.academia.atora-demo.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2026\\/03\\/Ministura-Psicologia-1024x683-1.jpg\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"image\"}],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"3c809e79\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":55},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"37fc2e43\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"Nuestra propuesta\",\"size\":\"small\",\"header_size\":\"h6\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"b31d27a\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"Una academia dise\\u00f1ada para formar criterio, voz y presencia\",\"size\":\"xl\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"cd9e111\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p>Academia Atm\\u00f3sfera Creativa re\\u00fane formaci\\u00f3n en comunicaci\\u00f3n, fotograf\\u00eda, narrativa visual y psicolog\\u00eda de la comunicaci\\u00f3n para desarrollar profesionales m\\u00e1s completos, sensibles y estrat\\u00e9gicos.<\\/p><p>No se trata solo de aprender teor\\u00eda. Se trata de adquirir herramientas reales para comunicar mejor, observar mejor, crear mejor y conectar mejor.<\\/p>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"},{\"id\":\"6bc8c6e7\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<ul><li><strong>Mentores con experiencia real:<\\/strong> aprende con profesionales que han vivido lo que ense\\u00f1an.<\\/li><li><strong>Aplicaci\\u00f3n inmediata:<\\/strong> lleva cada aprendizaje a tu trabajo, proyecto o pr\\u00e1ctica profesional.<\\/li><li><strong>Formaci\\u00f3n interdisciplinaria:<\\/strong> integra imagen, pensamiento, discurso y relaciones humanas.<\\/li><li><strong>Flexibilidad online:<\\/strong> avanza con profundidad y a tu ritmo.<\\/li><\\/ul>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":true}],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"19b83019\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"90\",\"right\":\"20\",\"bottom\":\"90\",\"left\":\"20\",\"isLinked\":false},\"flex_direction\":\"row\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"38f0d04d\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":55},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"6db881ed\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"Programa principal\",\"size\":\"small\",\"header_size\":\"h6\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"27fafe53\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"Lidera la narrativa digital: Diplomado en Comunicaci\\u00f3n Social, menci\\u00f3n Fotograf\\u00eda\",\"size\":\"large\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"2b82ec81\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p>Una experiencia formativa concebida para quienes desean dominar la comunicaci\\u00f3n contempor\\u00e1nea desde una mirada integral: pensamiento cr\\u00edtico, narrativa visual, fotograf\\u00eda, estrategia digital y comprensi\\u00f3n profunda del v\\u00ednculo humano.<\\/p><ul><li><strong>Modalidad:<\\/strong> 100% Online (flexibilidad total)<\\/li><li><strong>Duraci\\u00f3n:<\\/strong> 6 meses de inmersi\\u00f3n t\\u00e9cnica<\\/li><li><strong>Certificaci\\u00f3n:<\\/strong> Avalada por la trayectoria de Atm\\u00f3sfera Creativa y respaldo universitario<\\/li><\\/ul><p>Este diplomado re\\u00fane una selecci\\u00f3n de programas impartidos por mentores con trayectoria real, para ayudarte a construir una comunicaci\\u00f3n m\\u00e1s clara, m\\u00e1s humana y m\\u00e1s memorable.<\\/p>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"},{\"id\":\"4cf5f57\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"text\":\"Explorar cursos incluidos\",\"link\":{\"url\":\"#programas-destacados\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"button\"}],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"24765637\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":45},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"28217b28\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"image\":{\"id\":791,\"url\":\"http:\\/\\/beta.academia.atora-demo.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2026\\/03\\/Banner-Academia-Beta-1024x344-2.jpg\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"image\"}],\"isInner\":true}],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"24b38c1b\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"90\",\"right\":\"20\",\"bottom\":\"90\",\"left\":\"20\",\"isLinked\":false},\"_element_id\":\"programas-destacados\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"353b8ea3\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"Oferta formativa\",\"size\":\"small\",\"header_size\":\"h6\",\"align\":\"center\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"2701acab\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"Cursos y programas para profundizar tu formaci\\u00f3n\",\"size\":\"xl\",\"align\":\"center\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"5ad93ca9\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p>Cada curso aborda una dimensi\\u00f3n clave del comunicador contempor\\u00e1neo: pensamiento, imagen, discurso, relaciones humanas y estrategia narrativa.<\\/p>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"},{\"id\":\"5f0ca96a\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"flex_direction\":\"row\",\"gap\":\"22\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"2b36bf35\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":[],\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"c2df031\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"image\":{\"id\":792,\"url\":\"http:\\/\\/beta.academia.atora-demo.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2026\\/03\\/Portada-educaion-para-comunicadores2-300x169-1.jpg\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"image\"},{\"id\":\"452d5bc\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"Educaci\\u00f3n para comunicadores\",\"size\":\"medium\",\"header_size\":\"h3\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"250be2f8\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p><strong>Mentora: Dra. Natchaieving M\\u00e9ndez<\\/strong><\\/p><p>Una invitaci\\u00f3n a comprender la comunicaci\\u00f3n como una fuerza que educa, transforma y deja huella. Ideal para quienes desean comunicar con sensibilidad, profundidad e impacto humano.<\\/p>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"},{\"id\":\"6819495e\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"text\":\"Ver curso\",\"link\":{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/beta.academia.atora-demo.com\\/cursos\\/educacion-para-comunicadores\\/\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"button\"}],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"33f31554\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":[],\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"369bf1a3\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"image\":{\"id\":793,\"url\":\"http:\\/\\/beta.academia.atora-demo.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2026\\/03\\/Ministura-CZ-c1-peq.jpg\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"image\"},{\"id\":\"64c95aa1\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"Evoluci\\u00f3n Medi\\u00e1tica y Contexto Global\",\"size\":\"medium\",\"header_size\":\"h3\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"6d102742\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p><strong>Mentor: Carlos Zavarce<\\/strong><\\/p><p>Un recorrido anal\\u00edtico por la historia de los medios y la construcci\\u00f3n de la opini\\u00f3n p\\u00fablica. Perfecto para comprender el ecosistema comunicacional actual con m\\u00e1s criterio y contexto.<\\/p>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"},{\"id\":\"d0744bd\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"text\":\"Ver curso\",\"link\":{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/beta.academia.atora-demo.com\\/cursos\\/100-comunicacion-carlos-zavarce\\/\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"button\"}],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"1228a05f\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\