n y las redes sociales como espacios de influencia, pensamiento y construcci\\u00f3n de realidad.<\\/p>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"},{\"id\":\"122a4693\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"text\":\"Ver curso\",\"link\":{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/beta.academia.atora-demo.com\\/lm_course\\/creacion-de-discursos\\/\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"button\"}],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"5e6f9a04\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":[],\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"4a3d049c\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"image\":{\"id\":796,\"url\":\"http:\\/\\/beta.academia.atora-demo.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2026\\/03\\/Miniatura-Maestria-de-la-luzweb-1024x576-1.jpg\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"image\"},{\"id\":\"5787856b\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"Maestr\\u00eda de la Luz (Fotograf\\u00eda Avanzada)\",\"size\":\"medium\",\"header_size\":\"h3\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"1e512ef1\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p><strong>Mentores: Prof. Liduzka Derett y Luis Noguera<\\/strong><\\/p><p>Un recorrido por la t\\u00e9cnica fotogr\\u00e1fica desde la historia del arte, la sensibilidad est\\u00e9tica y el uso expresivo de luces y sombras para construir relatos visuales memorables.<\\/p>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"},{\"id\":\"7e929785\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"text\":\"Ver curso\",\"link\":{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/beta.academia.atora-demo.com\\/lm_course\\/maestria-de-la-luz\\/\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"button\"}],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"2bd5913a\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":[],\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"bb073c4\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"image\":{\"id\":797,\"url\":\"http:\\/\\/beta.academia.atora-demo.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2026\\/03\\/Captura-de-pantalla-2026-01-20-a-las-7.55.17-p.-m-1024x571-1.png\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"image\"},{\"id\":\"5ce133b4\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"ti