Diseño					</p>\n																	<img src=\"https://academia.atora-demo.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/wireframe-img-1-e1708013680578-2-1.png\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />													<p>\"Los cursos en ecosistema ATORA me han proporcionado las herramientas necesarias para impulsar mi carrera. La calidad es excepcional.\"</p>					\n									<h3>\n							María López						\n					</h3>\n									<p>\n						Diplomado en Marketing					</p>','Contacto','','publish','closed','closed','','contacto','','','2026-09-23 20:35:47','2026-09-23 20:35:47','',0,'https://academia.atmosferacreativa.com/contacto-2/',0,'page','',0),(4954,1,'2026-04-19 01:14:57','2026-04-19 05:14:57','','Tienda ecosistema ATORA','','trash','closed','closed','','tienda-2__trashed','','','2026-09-23 20:24:55','2026-09-23 20:24:55','',0,'https://academia.atmosferacreativa.com/tienda-2/',0,'page','',0),(4992,1,'2026-04-19 01:38:32','2026-04-19 05:38:32','','Header-academia-atm-negro','','inherit','open','closed','','header-academia-atm-negro','','','2026-04-19 01:38:32','2026-04-19 05:38:32','',0,'http://192.168.1.16:8080/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/Header-academia-atm-negro.png',0,'attachment','image/png',0),(4994,1,'2026-04-19 01:40:22','2026-04-19 05:40:22','','favicon','','inherit','open','closed','','favicon','','','2026-04-19 01:40:22','2026-04-19 05:40:22','',0,'http://192.168.1.16:8080/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/favicon.png',0,'attachment','image/png',0),(5000,0,'2026-04-19 02:33:25','2026-04-19 06:33:25','','Elementor-post-screenshot_529_2026-04-19-06-33-25_29cea222.png','','inherit','open','closed','','elementor-post-screenshot_529_2026-04-19-06-33-25_29cea222-png','','','2026-04-19 02:33:25','2026-04-19 06:33:25','',0,'http://192.168.1.16:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Elementor-post-screenshot_529_2026-04-19-06-33-25_29cea222.png',0,'attachment','image/png',0),(5001,0,'2026-04-19 02:33:28','2026-04-19 06:33:28','','Elementor-post-screenshot_1485_2026-04-19-06-33-28_1fb7a2a5.png','','inherit','open','closed','','elementor-post-screenshot_1485_2026-04-19-06-33-28_1fb7a2a5-png','','','2026-04-19 02:33:28','2026-04-19 06:33:28','',0,'http://192.168.1.16:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Elementor-post-screenshot_1485_2026-04-19-06-33-28_1fb7a2a5.png',0,'attachment','image/png',0),(5020,1,'2026-04-23 02:45:03','2026-04-23 06:45:03','','Los genios de la fotografía','Los genios de la fotografía','inherit','open','closed','','los-genios-de-la-luz','','','2026-04-23 02:45:03','2026-04-23 06:45:03','',141,'http://192.168.1.16:8080/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/Los-genios-de-la-luz.jpg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(5061,1,'2026-04-23 05:06:20','2026-04-23 09:06:20','<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":5} -->\n<h5 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Tu talento merece una guía a la altura de tus metas</h5>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|atora-gold\"}}}},\"backgroundColor\":\"ink\",\"textColor\":\"atora-gold\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-atora-gold-color has-ink-background-color has-text-color has-background has-link-color\">Conoce a nuestros mentores</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>En <b data-path-to-node=\"5\" data-index-in-node=\"3\">ecosistema ATORA</b>, hemos reunido a un equipo de expertos que no solo enseñan, sino que lideran proyectos. Nuestros mentores están aquí para acortar tu curva de aprendizaje y ayudarte a navegar el mercado actual.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|atora-gold\"}}}},\"backgroundColor\":\"ink\",\"textColor\":\"atora-gold\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-atora-gold-color has-ink-background-color has-text-color has-background has-link-color\">El valor de aprender de quienes ya están donde tú quieres estar</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>En el mundo de las industrias creativas, el conocimiento teórico es solo la mitad del camino. La otra mitad es la experiencia, los errores superados y la visión estratégica que solo un profesional en activo puede ofrecerte.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:shortcode -->\n[clms_teachers]\n<!-- /wp:shortcode -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Revisa nuestro formulario de contacto</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Si tienes preguntas sobre alguna disposición de estos Términos y Condiciones, nuestro equipo está disponible para aclararte cualquier punto antes de que formalices tu inscripción.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>								<a href=\"https://academia.atora-demo.com/contacto-2/\" id=\"TERM_form\"><br>\n									Ingresa Aquí<br>\n					</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3,\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|atora-gold\"}}}},\"backgroundColor\":\"ink\",\"textColor\":\"atora-gold\"} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-atora-gold-color has-ink-background-color has-text-color has-background has-link-color\">\n						Mentores con \"Calle\"					</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>						Aprende de profesionales que enfrentan los mismos retos que tú. Aquí no hay espacio para la teoría obsoleta; solo estrategias que funcionan en el mercado real.					</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3,\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|ink\"}}}},\"backgroundColor\":\"atora-gold\",\"textColor\":\"ink\"} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-ink-color has-atora-gold-background-color has-text-color has-background has-link-color\">Conexiones de Valor					</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>						Formar parte de nuestra academia te da acceso a una red de contactos de alto nivel. Nuestros mentores son el puente entre tu talento y las oportunidades de la industria.<br></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Mentores','Aprender de expertos en industrias creativas, mentorías personalizadas para emprendedores, cómo escalar un negocio creativo.','publish','closed','closed','','mentores','','','2026-09-23 20:35:47','2026-09-23 20:35:47','',0,'https://academia.atmosferacreativa.com/?page_id=5061',0,'page','',0),(5102,1,'2026-04-23 06:24:39','2026-04-23 10:24:39','','Fotógrafo-MPEG-4 - 3000','','inherit','open','closed','','fotografo-mpeg-4-3000','','','2026-04-23 06:24:39','2026-04-23 10:24:39','',0,'http://192.168.1.16:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Fotografo-MPEG-4-3000.mp4',0,'attachment','video/mp4',0),(5103,1,'2026-04-23 15:03:05','2026-04-23 19:03:05','','Programa de prueba','','publish','closed','closed','','programa-de-prueba','','','2026-09-23 21:20:05','2026-09-23 21:20:05','',0,'https://academia.atmosferacreativa.com/?post_type=lm_program&#038;p=5103',0,'lm_program','',0),(5167,1,'2026-04-25 13:24:42','2026-04-25 17:24:42','','legal-advisor-reviewing-compliance-documents-ensure-company-adherence-scaled.jpg','','inherit','open','closed','','legal-advisor-reviewing-compliance-documents-ensure-company-adherence-scaled-jpg','','','2026-04-25 13:24:42','2026-04-25 17:24:42','',0,'http://192.168.1.16:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/legal-advisor-reviewing-compliance-documents-ensure-company-adherence-scaled-1.jpg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(5229,0,'2026-04-26 22:55:08','2026-04-27 02:55:08','','Two smiling people in headsets are talking to the clients, while sitting at the desk in sunny modern office','Two smiling people in headsets are talking to the clients, while sitting at the desk in sunny modern office.','inherit','open','closed','','two-smiling-people-in-headsets-are-talking-to-the-clients-while-sitting-at-the-desk-in-sunny-modern-office','','','2026-04-26 22:55:08','2026-04-27 02:55:08','',0,'http://192.168.1.16:80