a ayudarte.					</p>\n												<a href=\"https://wa.me/584142315856\" id=\"CONTACTO_whatsapp\">\n									Saber más\n					</a>\n									<h2>Contáctanos</h2>					<h2>Información de contacto:</h2>		<p>Estamos aquí para responder a tus preguntas y proporcionarte la información que necesites.</p>					<ul>\n							<li>\n							<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 384 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M172.268 501.67C26.97 291.031 0 269.413 0 192 0 85.961 85.961 0 192 0s192 85.961 192 192c0 77.413-26.97 99.031-172.268 309.67-9.535 13.774-29.93 13.773-39.464 0zM192 272c44.183 0 80-35.817 80-80s-35.817-80-80-80-80 35.817-80 80 35.817 80 80 80z\"></path></svg>						\n										Av. San Juan Bosco - Altamira - Caracas\n									</li>\n								<li>\n											<a href=\"https://wa.me/584142315856\">\n							<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M497.39 361.8l-112-48a24 24 0 0 0-28 6.9l-49.6 60.6A370.66 370.66 0 0 1 130.6 204.11l60.6-49.6a23.94 23.94 0 0 0 6.9-28l-48-112A24.16 24.16 0 0 0 122.6.61l-104 24A24 24 0 0 0 0 48c0 256.5 207.9 464 464 464a24 24 0 0 0 23.4-18.6l24-104a24.29 24.29 0 0 0-14.01-27.6z\"></path></svg>						\n										+58 412 231 5856\n											</a>\n									</li>\n								<li>\n											<a href=\"mailto:info@academiaatmosfera.com\">\n							<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M502.3 190.8c3.9-3.1 9.7-.2 9.7 4.7V400c0 26.5-21.5 48-48 48H48c-26.5 0-48-21.5-48-48V195.6c0-5 5.7-7.8 9.7-4.7 22.4 17.4 52.1 39.5 154.1 113.6 21.1 15.4 56.7 47.8 92.2 47.6 35.7.3 72-32.8 92.3-47.6 102-74.1 131.6-96.3 154-113.7zM256 320c23.2.4 56.6-29.2 73.4-41.4 132.7-96.3 142.8-104.7 173.4-128.7 5.8-4.5 9.2-11.5 9.2-18.9v-19c0-26.5-21.5-48-48-48H48C21.5 64 0 85.5 0 112v19c0 7.4 3.4 14.3 9.2 18.9 30.6 23.9 40.7 32.4 173.4 128.7 16.8 12.2 50.2 41.8 73.4 41.4z\"></path></svg>						\n										info@academiaatmosfera.com\n											</a>\n									</li>\n						</ul>\n				<p>Puedes contactarnos a través del formulario o en nuestras redes sociales para más información.</p>					\n					<a target=\"_blank\">\n						Instagram\n						<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M224.1 141c-63.6 0-114.9 51.3-114.9 114.9s51.3 114.9 114.9 114.9S339 319.5 339 255.9 287.7 141 224.1 141zm0 189.6c-41.1 0-74.7-33.5-74.7-74.7s33.5-74.7 74.7-74.7 74.7 33.5 74.7 74.7-33.6 74.7-74.7 74.7zm146.4-194.3c0 14.9-12 26.8-26.8 26.8-14.9 0-26.8-12-26.8-26.8s12-26.8 26.8-26.8 26.8 12 26.8 26.8zm76.1 27.2c-1.7-35.9-9.9-67.7-36.2-93.9-26.2-26.2-58-34.4-93.9-36.2-37-2.1-147.9-2.1-184.9 0-35.8 1.7-67.6 9.9-93.9 36.1s-34.4 58-36.2 93.9c-2.1 37-2.1 147.9 0 184.9 1.7 35.9 9.9 67.7 36.2 93.9s58 34.4 93.9 36.2c37 2.1 147.9 2.1 184.9 0 35.9-1.7 67.7-9.9 93.9-36.2 26.2-26.2 34.4-58 36.2-93.9 2.1-37 2.1-147.8 0-184.8zM398.8 388c-7.8 19.6-22.9 34.7-42.6 42.6-29.5 11.7-99.5 9-132.1 9s-102.7 2.6-132.1-9c-19.6-7.8-34.7-22.9-42.6-42.6-11.7-29.5-9-99.5-9-132.1s-2.6-102.7 9-132.1c7.8-19.6 22.9-34.7 42.6-42.6 29.5-11.7 99.5-9 132.1-9s102.7-2.6 132.1 9c19.6 7.8 34.7 22.9 42.6 42.6 11.7 29.5 9 99.5 9 132.1s2.7 102.7-9 132.1z\"></path></svg>					</a>\n					<a target=\"_blank\">\n						Facebook-f\n						<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 320 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M279.14 288l14.22-92.66h-88.91v-60.13c0-25.35 12.42-50.06 52.24-50.06h40.42V6.26S260.43 0 225.36 0c-73.22 0-121.08 44.38-121.08 124.72v70.62H22.89V288h81.39v224h100.17V288z\"></path></svg>					</a>\n					<a target=\"_blank\">\n						Youtube\n						<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 576 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M549.655 124.083c-6.281-23.65-24.787-42.276-48.284-48.597C458.781 64 288 64 288 64S117.22 64 74.629 75.486c-23.497 6.322-42.003 24.947-48.284 48.597-11.412 42.867-11.412 132.305-11.412 132.305s0 89.438 11.412 132.305c6.281 23.65 24.787 41.5 48.284 47.821C117.22 448 288 448 288 448s170.78 0 213.371-11.486c23.497-6.321 42.003-24.171 48.284-47.821 11.412-42.867 11.412-132.305 11.412-132.305s0-89.438-11.412-132.305zm-317.51 213.508V175.185l142.739 81.205-142.739 81.201z\"></path></svg>					</a>\n					<a target=\"_blank\">\n						Tiktok\n						<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M448,209.91a210.06,210.06,0,0,1-122.77-39.25V349.38A162.55,162.55,0,1,1,185,188.31V278.2a74.62,74.62,0,1,0,52.23,71.18V0l88,0a121.18,121.18,0,0,0,1.86,22.17h0A122.18,122.18,0,0,0,381,102.39a121.43,121.43,0,0,0,67,20.14Z\"></path></svg>					</a>\n			<iframe loading=\"lazy\"\n					src=\"https://maps.google.com/maps?q=Av.%20San%20Juan%20Bosco%20-%20Altamira%20-%20Caracas&#038;t=m&#038;z=15&#038;output=embed&#038;iwloc=near\"\n					title=\"Av. San Juan Bosco - Altamira - Caracas\"\n					aria-label=\"Av. San Juan Bosco - Altamira - Caracas\"\n			></iframe>\n							<h2>¿Prefieres explorar primero? <br>Descubre nuestra oferta completa\n</h2>		<p>Antes de escribirnos, puedes navegar por nuestro catálogo de cursos para identificar el programa que mejor se ajusta a tus objetivos. Una vez que hayas encontrado lo que buscas, estaremos disponibles para guiarte en el proceso de inscripción.</p>								<a href=\"https://academia.atora-demo.com/tienda-2/\" id=\"CONTACTO_cursos\">\n				<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M313.941 216H12c-6.627 0-12 5.373-12 12v56c0 6.627 5.373 12 12 12h301.941v46.059c0 21.382 25.851 32.09 40.971 16.971l86.059-86.059c9.373-9.373 9.373-24.569 0-33.941l-86.059-86.059c-15.119-15.119-40.971-4.411-40.971 16.971V216z\"></path></svg>			\n									Ver Catálogo de Cursos\n					</a>\n																			<img src=\"https://academia.atora-demo.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/wireframe-img-1-e1708013680578-2-1.png\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />													<p>\"Gracias a ecosistema ATORA, he podido avanzar en mi carrera con aprendeido online. Los cursos son claros y muy prácticos.\"</p>					\n									<h3>\n							Juan Pérez						\n					</h3>\n									<p>\n						Curso de Diseño					</p>\n																	<img src=\"https://academia.atora-demo.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/wireframe-img-1-e1708013680578-2-1.png\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />													<p>\"Los cursos en ecosistema ATORA me han proporcionado las herramientas necesarias para impulsar mi carrera. La calidad es excepcional.\"</p>					\n									<h3>\n							María López						\n					</h3>\n									<p>\n						Diplomado en Marketing					</p>','Contacto','','inherit','closed','closed','','4953-revision-v1','','','2026-09-23 20:24:08','2026-09-23 20:24:08','',4953,'http://192.168.1.16:8080/?p=6577',0,'revision','',0),(6578,1,'2026-09-23 20:24:08','2026-09-23 20:24:08','<!-- wp:pagelayer/pl-post-props {\"post_password\":\"\",\"post_sticky\":\"\",\"post_category\":\"\",\"post_tags\":\"\",\"featured_image\":0,\"post_excerpt\":\"\",\"comment_status\":\"\",\"ping_status\":\"\",\"post_parent\":0,\"menu_order\":0,\"ele_bg_type\":\"color\",\"ele_bg_color\":\"$text\",\"pagelayer-id\":\"hvj5621\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:pagelayer/pl-row {\"col_gap\":\"10\",\"overlay_hover_delay\":\"400\",\"row_shape_top_width\":\"100\",\"row_shape_top_height\":\"100\",\"row_shape_bottom_width\":\"100\",\"row_shape_bottom_height\":\"100\",\"pagelayer-id\":\"73b7018\"} -->\n<!-- wp:pagelayer/pl-col {\"overlay_hover_delay\":\"400\",\"pagelayer-id\":\"08b4799\"} -->\n<!-- wp:pagelayer/pl-featured-img {\"img\":4292,\"align\":\"center\",\"ele_custom_pos\":\"true\",\"ele_align\":\"50%\",\"hide_desktop\":\"true\",\"hide_tablet\":\"true\",\"hide_mobile\":\"true\",\"pagelayer-id\":\"onm3457\",\"tmpAtts\":{\"img-full-url\":\"https://academia.atora-demo.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/Miniatura-VSL.jpg\",\"img-thumbnail-url\":\"https://academia.atora-demo.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/Miniatura-VSL-150x150.jpg\",\"img-medium-url\":\"https://academia.atora-demo.co